        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBSR33, Rectangular Victorian Rope Doorbell Button and Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana Victorian Rope Doorbell Button is made of solid brass and is available in 8 finishes choices so you'll be able to find the perfect mach for your home decor. The rope pattern is a traditional and beautiful classic. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"274\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBSR333-Specifications.gif?v=1704354574\" width=\"274\" height=\"244\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBSR333 Victorian Doorbell Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BBSR333 Rectangular Rope Pattern Doorbell Button:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Matching Finish Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
